 отрикошетит в указанном направлении.\nРикошет наносит урон всем существам на пути и останавливается при попадании в героя, накладывая на жертву страх, отчего та бежит по направлению рикошета.","desc_en":"Muerta fires a ghostly trickshot at an enemy unit or tree. When the bullet strikes, it damages and briefly slows, then ricochets in the targeted direction.\nThe ricochet damages all units that it passes through, stopping when it hits a hero. Heroes hit by the ricochet are feared away from the impact.","notes_ru":["Враг под действием страха проходит сквозь существ, и его нельзя замедлить.","Дальность рикошета — умноженная на 1.5 дальность применения способности.","Пуля отрикошетит, даже если цель невосприимчива к магии."],"notes_en":["Feared enemies are phased and unslowable.","The ricochet will travel 1.5x Dead Shot's cast range.","Can ricochet off of magic immune targets."],"specials":[{"key":"damage","system":false,"heading_ru":"УРОН:","heading_en":"DAMAGE:","values":[100.0,175.0,250.0,325.0],"percent":false,"values_scepter":[125.0]},{"key":"speed","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[2000.0],"percent":false},{"key":"radius","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[150.0],"percent":false},{"key":"ricochet_radius_start","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[115.0],"percent":false},{"key":"ricochet_radius_end","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[115.0],"percent":false},{"key":"ricochet_radius_expansion_per_second","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.0],"percent":false,"values_scepter":[300.0]},{"key":"ricochet_distance_multiplier","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[1.5],"percent":false},{"key":"ricochet_fear_duration","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДЛИТЕЛЬНОСТЬ СТРАХА ОТ РИКОШЕТА:","heading_en":"RICOCHET FEAR DURATION:","values":[0.8,0.95,1.1,1.25],"percent":false},{"key":"impact_slow_percent","system":false,"heading_ru":"ЗА