d turning them ethereal for 3s - rendering them immune to physical damage and unable to attack. The target is slowed and -20% more vulnerable to magic damage. Enemies will not be knocked out of Muerta's attack range.","notes_ru":[],"notes_en":[],"specials":[{"key":"projectile_speed","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[2500.0],"percent":false},{"key":"damage","system":false,"heading_ru":"УРОН:","heading_en":"DAMAGE:","values":[225.0],"percent":false},{"key":"knockback_distance","system":false,"heading_ru":"МАКС. ДАЛЬНОСТЬ ОТТАЛКИВАНИЯ:","heading_en":"MAX KNOCKBACK DISTANCE:","values":[250.0],"percent":false},{"key":"knockback_duration","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.2],"percent":false},{"key":"duration","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДЛИТЕЛЬНОСТЬ:","heading_en":"DURATION:","values":[3.0],"percent":false},{"key":"slow_pct","system":false,"heading_ru":"ЗАМЕДЛЕНИЕ ПЕРЕДВИЖЕНИЯ:","heading_en":"MOVEMENT SLOW:","values":[-30.0],"percent":true},{"key":"bonus_spell_damage_pct","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДОП. МАГИЧЕСКИЙ УРОН:","heading_en":"INCREASED MAGIC DAMAGE:","values":[-20.0],"percent":true},{"key":"AbilityCastRange","system":true,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[500.0],"percent":false},{"key":"AbilityCastPoint","system":true,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.2],"percent":false},{"key":"AbilityManaCost","system":true,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[75.0],"percent":false},{"key":"AbilityCooldown","system":true,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[12.0],"percent":false}],"shard":null,"scepter":null},{"key":"muerta_pierce_the_veil","id":5754,"hero":"muerta","name_ru":"Pierce the Veil","name_en":"Pierce the Veil","kind":"ultimate","innate":false,"granted_by_scepter":false,"granted_by_shard":false,"max_level":3,"behavior":["no_target"],"behavior_ru":["без цели"],"target_team":[],"target_type":[],"target_flags":[],"damage_type":"magical","bkb_pierce":null,"immunity_code":0,"immunity":"none","dispellable":"no","cooldown":[75.0,60.0,45.0],"mana_cost":[150.0,250.0,350.0],"health_cost":[],"gold_cost":[],"cast_range":[],"cast_point":[],"channel_time":[],"duration":[],"desc_ru":"Герой принимает бесплотную форму, получая бонус к базовому урону и возможность проходить сквозь существ.\nПассивно позволяет герою совершать атаки в бесплотной форме и атаковать бесплотных существ. Если герой или его цель бесплотны, весь урон от его атак становится магическим, а физический вампиризм считается вампиризмом заклинаниями.\nТИП РАЗВЕИВАНИЯ: нормальное","desc_en":"Muerta transforms, becoming ethereal, gaining bonus base damage and phased movement.\nPassively allows Muerta to always attack ethereal targets and attack when she is ethereal. When either she or her target is ethereal, all of her attack damage is dealt as magical damage and her physical lifesteal is treated as spell lifesteal.\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel","notes_ru":["Превращение сбивает с цели летящие в героя снаряды.","Под действием этой способности нельзя атаковать постройки."],"notes_en":["Muerta will dodge projectiles upon transformation.","Muerta cannot attack buildings while transformed."],"specials":[{"key":"duration","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДЛИТЕЛЬНОСТЬ ЭФФЕКТА:","heading_en":"DURATION:","values":[8.0],"percent":false,"talents":[{"talent":"special_bonus_unique_muerta_pierce_the_veil_duration","level":20,"op":"add","value":2,"values_with":[10.0]}]},{"key":"transform_duration","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДЛИТЕЛЬНОСТЬ ПРЕВРАЩЕНИЯ:","heading_en":"TRANSFORM DURATION:","values":[0.35],"percent":false},{"key":"base_damage_percent","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДОП. БАЗОВЫЙ УРОН:","heading_en":"BASE DAMAGE BONUS:","values":[70.0,85.0,100.0],"percent":true},{"key":"modelscale","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[30.0],"percent":false},{"key":"AbilityManaCost","system":true,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[150.0,250.0,350.0],"percent":false},{"key":"AbilityCooldown","system":true,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[75.0,60.0,45.0],"percent":false}],"shard":{"text_ru":"Способность также даёт +[?]% к вампиризму заклинаниями.\nКогда эта способность действует, её владелец навсегда получает +[?]% к урону от заклинаний за каждого погибшего рядом или убитого вражеского героя. Эффекты накапливаются с начала игры.","text_en":"Muerta gains [?]% Spell Lifesteal during Pierce the Veil.\nWhile Pierce the Veil is active Muerta permanently gains [?]% spell amplification each time she kills an enemy Hero or they die in her vicinity. Bonus applies retroactively.","changes":[]},"scepter":null},{"key":"muerta_supernatural","id":1436,"hero":"muerta","name_ru":"Supernatural","name_en":"Supernatural","kind":"basic","innate":true,"granted_by_scepter":false,"granted_by_shard":false,"max_level":1,"behavior":["hidden","passive","bit49"],"behavior_ru":["скрытая","пассивная"],"target_team":[],"target_type":[],"target_flags":[],"damage_type":null,"bkb_pierce":null,"immunity_code":0,"immunity":"none","dispellable":null,"cooldown":[],"mana_cost":[],"health_cost":[],"gold_cost":[],"cast_range":[],"cast_point":[],"channel_time":[],"duration":[],"desc_ru":"Когда в радиусе 925 погибает вражеский герой, владелец способности получает один эффект, дающий +1% к урону заклинаниями. Погибнув, владелец теряет половину эффектов с округлением в меньшую сторону.","desc_en":"Whenever an enemy hero dies within 925 units of Muerta, she gains a stack of 1% spell amplification. When Muerta dies she loses half the stacks, rounded down.","notes_ru":[],"notes_en":[],"specials":[{"key":"stack_collection_range","system":false,"heading_ru":"РАДИУС ПОЛУЧЕНИЯ ЭФФЕКТОВ:","heading_en":"COLLECTION RANGE:","values":[925.0],"percent":false},{"key":"spell_amp_per_stack","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДОП. УРОН ОТ ЗАКЛИНАНИЙ ЗА ЭФФЕКТ:","heading_en":"SPELL AMP PER STACK:","values":[1.0],"percent":true},{"key":"max_stacks","system":false,"heading_ru":"МАКС. ДОПОЛНИТЕЛЬ